  "comment": {
    "text": "Hint above the people list in the panel that changes the owner of a skill set: who may be picked. Room admin and Full admin are user roles and keep their usual names, room admin included. No full stop. Skill set = a room of skills, Markdown instructions the AI assistant follows; never call it a room. Match the term in Common:DeleteSkillSet.",
